# A small hypergraph for the triad_count examples and the "Hypergraph triads" tutorial: one
# hyperedge per line, vertex ids 1..10 (1-based, as ESCHER-GPU's files); line 10 repeats line 1,
# which dedupe_hyperedges drops, so the hypergraph has 11 hyperedges, ids 0..10.
1 2 3
2 3 4
3 4 5
1 3 5
5 6 7
6 7 8
1 5 7 9
2 4 6 8
7 8 9 10
1 2 3
3 9 10
4 5 6
